      "heading": "Right-click. Roll up.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFDFC",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Right-click. Roll up. Keep the windows you're not using open and within reach. Unroll them when you're ready. Right-click an empty caption Right-click an empty caption area of an eligible window to roll it up. Right-click again to unroll. Drag to move Left-drag a rolled title bar to move the window. Its contents stay collapsed. A plain left click focuses it.",
