      "backgroundColor": "#FBF3EE",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "Control from the tray Keep windows rolled, unroll when needed, and exit safely. Pause / Enable Pause gestures and keep windows rolled. Enable resumes gestures. Unroll all Expand managed windows. Keep the current pause mode. Exit Unroll before quitting. Retry from the tray if expansion fails.",
