      "callsToAction": [
        "Read the usage guide"
      ],
      "text": "Get started One portable x64 executable, written in Rust. No injected DLL. Run normally, without administrator privileges. Read the usage guide Build from source Requires Rust's Windows MSVC toolchain, Visual Studio C++ build tools and Windows SDK. git clone https://github.com/jedipi/WinRoll-RS.git cd WinRoll-RS cargo build --release --locked .\\target\\release\\winroll.exe",
